      "id": "2124681075117179026",
      "text": "Joel Kiviranta converts a back-door tap-in from Wyatt Johnston to give Dallas the lone goal of this game, his third of the yr. The last three times the @penguins beat Dallas after trailing after 2 have all come IN Dallas: 4/25/25, 2/29/12, 11/9/91 (MIN). 3rd on @SNPittsburgh!",
