      "quoted_author": "Pittsburgh Penguins",
      "quoted_handle": "penguins"
    },
    {
      "id": "2124680673063518497",
      "text": "That was a much better second period, relatively speaking. Arturs Silovs was really strong. The Penguins did find themselves in the box a couple of times, but killed off both of the Stars' power plays.",
